S theorem Minidregg.Compiler.SemanticManifest.Manifest.WellFormed.codecIdsUnique : ∀ {manifest : Minidregg.Compiler.SemanticManifest.Manifest}, manifest.WellFormed → manifest.CodecIdsUnique
