S theorem Minidregg.Kernel.Seats.single_at : ∀ (p : Minidregg.Theory.CanonicalResourceKernel.AccountId × Minidregg.Theory.CanonicalResourceKernel.AssetId) (v : ℤ) (account : Minidregg.Theory.CanonicalResourceKernel.AccountId) (asset : Minidregg.Theory.CanonicalResourceKernel.AssetId), (DFinsupp.single p v) (account, asset) = if account = p.1 ∧ asset = p.2 then v else 0
