S theorem Minidregg.Selvage.AccExample.badPair_not_satisfied : ¬Minidregg.Selvage.AccClaim.Satisfies (Minidregg.Selvage.reedSolomonCode Minidregg.Selvage.RSExample.dom₅ 2) Minidregg.Selvage.AccExample.badPair Minidregg.Selvage.RSExample.xWord
