S inductive Minidregg.Theory.PrivacyProfile : Type u_1 → Type u_2 → Type u_3 → Type u_4 → Type u_5 → Type u_6 → Type (max (max (max (max (max u_1 u_2) u_3) u_4) u_5) u_6)
