 → ((incidence : Minidregg.Kernel.DeclaredResourceController.Incidence command) → Minidregg.Kernel.DeclaredResourceController.CheckedLeg prepared tuple incidence (signed.envelope command incidence)) → Minidregg.Kernel.DeclaredResourceController.AcceptedInvocation prepared signed
